                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure—Clipping from Venezuelan
                    Herald.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">mixed tribunals.</hi></head>
                <p>The mixed German-Venezuelan tribunal has closed its sittings after four months’
                    sessions, during which 23 claims were presented, amounting to 5,619,031 marks;
                    two claims amounting to 500,000 marks and one relating to the navigation of the
                    Catatumbo for 2,400,000 marks were disallowed. Of the remaining ones which were
                    taken into consideration, 1,673,527 marks have been awarded.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
